{"name": "Dungeons & Desserts", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Dungeons &amp; Desserts</strong> is a cozy dungeon crawler meets bakery sim. Crawl candy-themed dungeons for ingredients, craft desserts to sell, and try not to miss rent, or your landlord takes your furniture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Running a bakery isn\u2019t easy, especially with a greedy, micromanaging landlord breathing down your neck. Every week, they make up new fees and increase the rent, forcing Crispin to work harder just to keep his business afloat. Don\u2019t miss too many payments, or you could lose everything.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Features</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Explore the candy-themed dungeons, fight candy foes, and collect exotic ingredients for your bakery.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"320\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996900/extras/7f7dcef969f91fe9ae31fefad535e518.poster.avif?t=1780629611\" width=\"640\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996900/extras/7f7dcef969f91fe9ae31fefad535e518.webm?t=1780629611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Craft mouthwatering desserts, stock your displays, and serve customers to keep your shop running.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"320\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996900/extras/908c18730590322c55f04b44f0f4ba3c.poster.avif?t=1780629611\" width=\"640\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996900/extras/908c18730590322c55f04b44f0f4ba3c.webm?t=1780629611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Upgrade your kitchen, attract more customers, and boost productivity to stay ahead of the ever-increasing rent.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"320\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996900/extras/78a5d06c45286e56f1448ef7cfc34f16.poster.avif?t=1780629611\" width=\"640\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996900/extras/78a5d06c45286e56f1448ef7cfc34f16.webm?t=1780629611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Race Against Time \u2013 With limited daily actions, you must balance exploration, baking, and shopkeeping before the next rent deadline.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" crossorigin=\"anonymous\" height=\"320\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996900/extras/f396f404d4d9f7d491d4f362f0350b94.poster.avif?t=1780629611\" width=\"640\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996900/extras/f396f404d4d9f7d491d4f362f0350b94.webm?t=1780629611\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/></video></span></p> </div>", "short_desc": "Dungeons & Desserts is a roguelite dungeon crawler where you also manage a pastry shop. Journey through candy-themed realms, gather rare ingredients and craft mouth-watering desserts to sell in your cosy bakery, all while balancing the pressures of a greedy landlord constantly increasing your rent.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2996900/cf63431ea41e86f54a56976ac34018c5833264a0/header.jpg?t=1780629611", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["RPG", "Capitalism", "Cooking", "Dungeon Crawler", "Action", "Time Management"], "developers": "Top Chop Games", "publishers": "Top Chop Games", "release_date": "Q4 2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "2996900", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "12 March 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/KbzZStXuyFw", "first_seen": 1773270000.0, "review_rank": 1006}